      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "45.8 grams of fat. Saturated fat is 5.6 grams, a strong mark relative to the total fat. Omega 3 is only 212 milligrams, so this is not an omega 3-rich nut. For nuts, fat quality has to justify the calorie density. This is a mixed section: a clean saturated-fat mark, but weak omega 3.",
