    {
      "id": "05-proteins",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "proteins",
      "text": "21.1 grams of protein. Essential amino acids score 9 out of 9, meaning all 9 groups that the body cannot make clear the useful threshold. Bioavailability is 83%, so the protein is fairly usable after digestion. That is a strong protein result for a nut, even though fat quality and fibre still matter more.",
      "textSha256": "6d0aa1fd380196a1500620d195615084a9893019545166a63a5a0d4a1750b38a",
      "characterCount": 306,
