    {
      "id": "06-vitamins",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamin E is 14% daily value, providing some useful antioxidant support. Vitamin E helps protect cells from oxidative damage, but 14% is helpful rather than exceptional. For nuts, vitamin E is the headline vitamin, although it is not strong enough to carry the whole score here.",
      "textSha256": "f64302c8c3219662d35aa1e23257b52f25d62597b6d3247d9c16558823cc27f3",
      "characterCount": 278,
      "byteLength": 261268,
