    {
      "id": "07-minerals",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "minerals",
      "text": "Magnesium is 26% daily value, supporting energy production plus normal nerve and muscle function. Iron is 22% daily value, a softer mark than magnesium but still a useful contribution towards oxygen transport. For nuts, solid minerals help justify the dense calories.",
      "textSha256": "d04fb9870675b88d9437c22f2d00c5f26ce33f66050a51c7044b4ae2805d435b",
      "characterCount": 267,
