    {
      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "The upsides first: portable and shelf-stable. They are easy to keep around and need no preparation. Roasted crunch makes a small serving satisfying. The texture and savoury flavour make a measured portion feel more substantial than many light packaged snacks. Still resembles the food it came from. Even roasted and salted, it remains closer to a whole food than most savoury snacks.",
      "textSha256": "522ab43309883e1a793e0c3baf55d89be0ff6036e59b0b837a7b2e713626a43d",
      "characterCount": 383,
      "byteLength": 311005,
      "mediaDurationSeconds": 19.409,
      "audioFile": "/studio-data/uploads/narration/pistachios-roasted-salted/08-pros.mp3",
      "elevenLabs": {
        "requestId": "Om5C15thXwAa3qTJfTCM",
        "historyItemId": "hW2hWJOFCsLLYr5gDc5I"
      },
      "productionAudioFile": "production/episodes/pistachios-roasted-salted/voice/voice-v1-blocks/08-pros.mp3",
      "filename": "08-pros.mp3",
      "docsAudioFile": "audio/episodes/pistachios-roasted-salted/voice-v1-blocks/08-pros.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 19.409,
      "offsetSeconds": 90.525,
      "wordCount": null,
      "loss": null
    },
    {
      "id": "09-cons",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "cons",
      "text": "The drawbacks next: the salt adds a sodium tradeoff. This exact entry has 428 milligrams of sodium per 100 grams. Handfuls add up quickly. The dense, snackable format makes casual portions easy to overshoot. Nut allergy rules them out for some people. That is a hard practical limit, not a tiny nutritional downside.",
      "textSha256": "fd93caea77a828518061c0df6581805dad3a2d486fcc43c1db7bb38148a8cc94",
      "characterCount": 316,
      "byteLength": 305154,
      "mediaDurationSeconds": 19.043,
      "audioFile": "/studio-data/uploads/narration/pistachios-roasted-salted/09-cons.mp3",
      "elevenLabs": {
        "requestId": "hIaIxqGzEb6PcNvR7B1P",
        "historyItemId": "UkmEHAiesbFwxTpyCGur"
      },
      "productionAudioFile": "production/episodes/pistachios-roasted-salted/voice/voice-v1-blocks/09-cons.mp3",
      "filename": "09-cons.mp3",
      "docsAudioFile": "audio/episodes/pistachios-roasted-salted/voice-v1-blocks/09-cons.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 19.043,
      "offsetSeconds": 110.014,
      "wordCount": null,
      "loss": null
    },
    {
      "id": "10-closing_summary",
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "closing_summary",
      "sectionKey": null,
      "text": "Best bits are fibre, broad essential amino acid coverage, a low glycemic index, useful vitamin E and magnesium, plus portable whole-food convenience. Weak spots are modest omega 3, added sodium, portion creep, and allergy risk. Best for satisfying snacks or meal toppings in measured portions, where the protein and fibre make them more substantial. This is a strong nut held back slightly by the salted, easy-to-overeat format.",
      "textSha256": "e3bc7ebb3994e168ff93b80d7720bb14049f68b15f241bbbbc82b7d9e6898fbd",
